  "ai_keys.17": "Planned Education does not process AI natively to ensure 100% data sovereignty. Teachers can connect their own ChatGPT account directly below (via OpenAI Device-Code Sign-In, no API key required) or connect an external LLM to our anonymized API endpoint.",
